WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.261 --> 00:00:02.742
- I lost 32 followers on Facebook.

00:00:02.742 --> 00:00:06.162
(upbeat techno music)

00:00:11.403 --> 00:00:13.397
This might be my biggest
challenge I've ever had.

00:00:13.397 --> 00:00:16.207
- I'm super super nervous.

00:00:16.207 --> 00:00:17.438
- I'd just like to tell everybody

00:00:17.438 --> 00:00:19.836
that I love them and I
hope I get through this.

00:00:19.836 --> 00:00:22.137
Would Donald Trump really be that bad?

00:00:22.137 --> 00:00:23.670
- I'm not usually one for
bets, but if I was going

00:00:23.670 --> 00:00:25.202
to put money down, I'd bet on Trump.

00:00:25.202 --> 00:00:27.420
- The one candidate
that seems least likely

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.218
to pander to outside groups is Trump.

00:00:30.218 --> 00:00:31.204
- That was pretty good.

00:00:32.764 --> 00:00:36.202
(dramatic orchestra music)

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.019
(click)

00:00:38.019 --> 00:00:40.019
(laughter)

00:00:40.019 --> 00:00:41.261
- Post.

00:00:41.261 --> 00:00:42.201
(laughter)

00:00:45.431 --> 00:00:46.111
- It's loading.

00:00:46.111 --> 00:00:46.982
- Oh.

00:00:46.982 --> 00:00:47.740
- Oh it's up!

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:48.313
- I hate this.

00:00:50.433 --> 00:00:51.012
(laughter)

00:00:51.012 --> 00:00:54.855
- No way this comment, "Is
this a hostage situation?".

00:00:55.725 --> 00:00:57.009
- I lost four followers.

00:00:57.009 --> 00:00:57.469
- [Voiceover] No you didn't.

00:00:57.469 --> 00:00:58.816
- Yea I did, I swear to God.

00:00:58.816 --> 00:01:00.012
- Yours is so long.

00:01:00.012 --> 00:01:01.208
- Oh wait, I got one I got one.

00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:02.578
- Awww.

00:01:02.578 --> 00:01:03.508
- Awwww, no!

00:01:03.508 --> 00:01:06.629
- It's been 15 minutes.

00:01:07.919 --> 00:01:10.674
(laughter)

00:01:15.654 --> 00:01:18.650
- So I've lost eight Facebook followers.

00:01:18.650 --> 00:01:21.982
- So far I've lost six Facebook followers.

00:01:21.982 --> 00:01:23.352
- You're not going to believe it,

00:01:23.352 --> 00:01:26.452
but I'm actually gaining followers.

00:01:28.162 --> 00:01:32.370
- So far I've lost 14 followers.

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:35.110
I got 13 likes on status though.

00:01:35.110 --> 00:01:37.444
- I just got a frantic
text message from one

00:01:37.444 --> 00:01:39.771
of my friends demanding answers.

00:01:41.071 --> 00:01:42.117
- I just got a text from my girlfriend

00:01:42.117 --> 00:01:44.465
because our friend texted her asking

00:01:44.465 --> 00:01:47.105
if I was serious or not.

00:01:47.105 --> 00:01:49.199
I'm starting to legitimately feel bad.

00:01:49.199 --> 00:01:53.181
- Each time I get a Facebook
notification I just cringe.

00:01:54.111 --> 00:01:55.790
- This was a bad idea.

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:58.399
(instrumental rock beat)

00:01:58.399 --> 00:02:01.673
- By the end of the day
I was down 31 followers.

00:02:01.673 --> 00:02:03.612
- I lost 32 followers.

00:02:03.612 --> 00:02:05.455
- There are people in
this world that think

00:02:05.455 --> 00:02:07.359
I will vote for Donald Trump.

00:02:07.359 --> 00:02:10.575
- A surprising number of
my friends like the status.

00:02:10.575 --> 00:02:12.569
- A few people called me out for trolling

00:02:12.569 --> 00:02:14.774
and then I started to get like,

00:02:14.774 --> 00:02:17.294
people I haven't spoken to since college.

00:02:17.294 --> 00:02:19.175
Most of them were angry at me.

00:02:19.175 --> 00:02:20.359
- A lot of people yelled at me.

00:02:20.359 --> 00:02:22.658
Other people yelled at other people.

00:02:22.658 --> 00:02:25.073
It was a typical Facebook argument.

00:02:25.073 --> 00:02:27.940
- I would like to apologize
to my Facebook followers.

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:28.927
- That's true.

00:02:28.927 --> 00:02:30.750
- I'm sorry I deceived you.

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.384
- I'm sorry that I did something
that wasn't really funny.

00:02:34.384 --> 00:02:37.200
(upbeat techno music)

